star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->I recently hired Danny and Malden for an end-of-tenancy clean, as well as a deep clean for my sofa and mattress. I couldn’t be more satisfied with the results!

Danny and Malden were incredibly thorough and paid attention to every detail. From the kitchen to the bathrooms, every surface was left spotless, and they even managed to remove stubborn stains. Our oven likes like brand new! I thought would be impossible to get rid of. The place was left in immaculate condition, which greatly impressed my landlord.

Sofa &amp; Mattress Cleaning:
The professional sofa and mattress cleaning was equally fantastic. Both the sofa and mattress look as good as new, and the fresh smell was an added bonus. It’s clear they used high-quality products and equipment, as even the deepest stains were completely removed.

Professionalism &amp; Punctuality:
They arrived on time, were very friendly, and worked efficiently without cutting any corners. Their professionalism and dedication to doing a great job really stood out.

I highly recommend Danny and Malden for anyone looking for reliable, high-quality cleaning services. They’ve made moving out and refreshing my furniture so much easier!

Thank you so much!

Katie<br /><br /><span class="ti-reply-by-owner-title">Owner's reply</span><br />Dear Katie , Thank you for taking the time to leave such a wonderful review! We're so glad to hear that you loved our cleaning services. Your satisfaction is our top priority, and your feedback motivates our team to keep doing great work. We look forward to helping you again soon! Best wishes, Clean House Solutions Ltd.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1725753600" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIzmKtTjZeUVZL2vELuJZXDGN4wMsW1LdKxPond3N3BYYzhQA=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" alt="Pauline owen profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Pauline owen </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><tr